  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2102.23 Hydroelectric Power Producers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2102.23 Hydroelectric Power Producers. Any producer of hydroelectric power providing power production data to the New Hampshire public utilities commission (PUC) who has provided a means of approximating the volume of water used in that power production shall be deemed to be in compliance with this part if:\n\n(a) The information being provided to the PUC includes the information required by Env-Wq 2102.18; and\n\n(b) A copy of the information is provided to the department.\n\nSource. #9279, eff 9-24-08; ss by #12135, eff 3-21-17 (from Env-Wq 2102.22)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq2100.html"
